---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="实验室" description="仅列出当前已实现并明确边界的本地实验">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl border-4 border-[#0284c7] bg-white p-5 shadow-[7px_7px_0_0_#f59e0b] dark:bg-slate-800 sm:p-8"><h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-[#075985] dark:text-[#bae6fd]">实验室</h1><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-4"><li class="border-2 border-[#0284c7] p-4"><h2 class="text-xl font-black">统一公开搜索</h2><p class="mt-2 font-bold leading-7">已实现：只接收构建期公开索引，在浏览器本地筛选。</p><a class="mt-3 flex min-h-[44px] items-center font-black underline" href="/search">打开搜索</a></li><li class="border-2 border-[#0284c7] p-4"><h2 class="text-xl font-black">随机探索</h2><p class="mt-2 font-bold leading-7">已实现：只从本次构建生成的公开 HTML 路由中选择。</p><a class="mt-3 flex min-h-[44px] items-center font-black underline" href="/explore">打开随机探索</a></li><li class="border-2 border-dashed border-[#0284c7] p-4"><h2 class="text-xl font-black">WebMCP</h2><p class="mt-2 font-bold leading-7">尚未完成浏览器能力与安全边界验证，因此当前不注册或暴露任何 WebMCP 工具。</p></li></ul></section>
</Layout>
